💡 Key Learnings & Takeaways
Clustering choice matters: Different linkage methods (like single vs. complete) drastically change the shape and hierarchy of dendrograms.

Visualization aids interpretation: t-SNE acts as a "map" for high-dimensional financial or biological data, revealing underlying clusters that standard linear methods might miss.

Efficiency through PCA: PCA eliminates multicollinearity (correlation between features) without losing underlying sample information, setting the stage for more accurate supervised learning models.
